# Roadmap authority

Before proposing or implementing any new feature or significant non-bug work:

1. Read `docs/ROADMAP.md` (backend: `UletiSmenu/docs/ROADMAP.md`; frontend: `docs/ROADMAP.md`).
2. Confirm the work matches the current phase or Soft Launch checklist.
3. If it does not align, explain why and **ask before proceeding**.

When finishing a milestone, update ROADMAP status in the same change set and keep copies in sync across repos.

Project vision: launch a production-ready hospitality hiring platform in Serbia ASAP — avoid feature creep.

Default workflow: implement on **`develop` → TEST**, then PR to **`main` → LIVE**.

Environment language: LIVE / PROD / Production and TEST. Azure resources named `*staging*` are often LIVE (legacy). Do not casually rename cloud resources.
